\newlabel{fig:prosody}{{1}{9}{Per-audio-minute RMS energy for the 2021 England--Ukraine match (England won 4--0). Dotted line: goal-independent kick-off estimate; dashed lines: the four goals mapped through that estimate plus a fixed half-time gap. Goals cluster on local energy maxima, but the visible imperfection of the mapping is exactly the alignment bottleneck quantified in Section~\ref {sec:prosody}}{figure.caption.7}{}}
