\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces LED fine-tuning run~5 (clean dataset). Validation ROUGE-L (blue, left axis) peaks at 0.270 at epoch~12; evaluation loss (red, right axis) decreases monotonically. The selected checkpoint (epoch~12) yields test ROUGE-L~$=$~0.248. Contrast with pre-fix run~3 (11 epochs, peak 0.172), where identical-looking loss curves masked a ROUGE collapse caused by the empty-reference dataset bug.}}{11}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:led_curve}{{2}{11}{LED fine-tuning run~5 (clean dataset). Validation ROUGE-L (blue, left axis) peaks at 0.270 at epoch~12; evaluation loss (red, right axis) decreases monotonically. The selected checkpoint (epoch~12) yields test ROUGE-L~$=$~0.248. Contrast with pre-fix run~3 (11 epochs, peak 0.172), where identical-looking loss curves masked a ROUGE collapse caused by the empty-reference dataset bug}{figure.caption.10}{}}
